OL,3,ASome under-25s should get fewer
OL,4,Abenefits, Milburn review to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilburn, a former Labour health
OL,7,Fsecretary, has been tasked by the
OL,8,Fgovernment with helping reduce the one
OL,9,Fin eight 16 to 24 year-olds in the UK
OL,10,Fwho are not in education, employment or
OL,11,Ftraining - otherwise known as "Neet".
OL,13,FHe said on Wednesday night that his
OL,14,Fplans would not be "pain-free" and
OL,15,Fwould affect both existing and new
OL,16,Fclaimants.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
