OL,3,AUS envoys meet Zelensky in Dublin after
OL,4,Atalks with Putin in Moscow
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS envoys Jared Kushner and Steve
OL,7,FWitkoff held a fresh round of talks
OL,8,Fwith Russian President Vladimir Putin
OL,9,Fin Moscow, a day after the latest
OL,10,Fdiscussions aimed at ending the war in
OL,11,FUkraine wrapped up in Abu Dhabi.
OL,13,FThe pair are now in Dublin to meet
OL,14,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky,
OL,15,Fand Witkoff said a new round of
OL,16,Ftrilateral talks had already been
OL,17,Fagreed with Putin.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
