OL,3,AUS envoys meet Zelensky in Dublin after
OL,4,Atalks with Putin in Moscow
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a sign of further tension,
OL,7,FZelensky said on Thursday morning that
OL,8,FUkraine's military was again facing
OL,9,F"systematic" restrictions to Starlink's
OL,10,Fmilitary-grade satellite service,
OL,11,FStarshield, meaning Kyiv was struggling
OL,12,Fto intercept Russian jet-powered
OL,13,Fdrones.
OL,15,FThe peace talks in the Emirates were
OL,16,Fframed as being centred around European
OL,17,Fsecurity arrangements in a post-war
OL,18,Fscenario, although a resolution to the
OL,19,Fwar sparked by Russia's full-scale
OL,20,Finvasion of Ukraine in 2022 still
OL,21,Fappears distant.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
