OL,3,AOne killed and four injured in
OL,4,AWashington DC shooting as police
OL,5,Aconfirm suspect also dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficers - who were at the scene
OL,8,F"within 30 seconds" - also say they
OL,9,F"believe there was some sort of
OL,10,Fconflict" between the suspect and the
OL,11,Fapartment building
OL,13,FBBC producer Jonathan Csapo, who lives
OL,14,Fnearby, says: Gunshots went off very,
OL,15,Fvery close to where I was. I could see
OL,16,Fthe smoke, I could see the flash. We
OL,17,Fjust all started running
OL,19,FThe shooting happened inside and near a
OL,20,Fgym in Logan Circle - one witness
OL,21,Fthought an exercise ball had popped,
OL,22,Fwhen in fact someone had been shot
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
